abstract: >-
  Companion code for "Residual Drift Detectors under a Common False-Alarm
  Budget: A Calibrated Comparison with a Wasserstein Detector". Includes a
  Wasserstein-distance drift detector, synthetic calibration and benchmark
  workflows, and a soil-moisture upstream-change case study.
repository-code: https://github.com/FBK-OpenIoT/calibrated-wasserstein-drift
url: https://github.com/FBK-OpenIoT/calibrated-wasserstein-drift
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - concept drift
  - drift detection
  - data streams
  - machine learning
  - Wasserstein distance
